        "title": "Crafted to the last detail.",
        "text": "<p>Every Luminor product is crafted with obsessive attention to detail — from premium materials to precision engineering. No compromises, no shortcuts.</p><p>We obsess over the details that no one should ever notice, but would miss immediately if they weren't there.</p>",
