        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "Designed with intention. Built to last.",
        "text": "<p>We believe great design is invisible. Every product in the Luminor collection is the result of obsessive refinement — stripping away the unnecessary until only the essential remains.</p><p>From premium materials to precision engineering, we hold ourselves to a single standard: would we use it every day?</p>",
        "button_label": "Shop the collection",
